    "title": "Upland Hills Health welcomes Josh Baker, PA-C as new provider",
    "text": "Dr. Mark Thompson, CEO | Upland Hills Health\nDr. Mark Thompson, CEO | Upland Hills Health\nUpland Hills Health has announced the addition of Josh Baker, PA-C, as a new provider. The organization states its commitment to delivering safe and high-quality care for all patients who use its clinics, hospital, nursing and rehab center, medical equipment store, or home-based services such as Home Care and Hospice.\n\" We are committed to providing the safest and best possible experience for every patient that enters our clinics, our hospital, our nursing and rehab center, our medical equipment store, or who invites us into their home through Home Care or Hospice services.\"\nThe introduction of Josh Baker is part of ongoing efforts by Upland Hills Health to expand its team and enhance patient services in various healthcare settings.",
